# Root-level scratch / API-response dumps (may contain live JWTs + admin PII).
# Ignore ALL root-level .json except the three real config files, so ad-hoc
# dumps like qa_login.json / admins.json can never be committed by accident.
# A new legitimate root config must be explicitly un-ignored below.
/*.json
!/package.json
!/tsconfig.base.json
!/turbo.json
